        <source>::Leave.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">::Залиш.::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q10" name="=&gt;q10">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">20</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::You push as hard as you can, but the heavy block won't move.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">::Ти штовхаєш щосили, але важкий блок не рухається.::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q11" name="=&gt;q11">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">22</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::The wall has a hole in it that's large enough for you to go through.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">::У стіні є діра, достатньо велика, щоб ти міг пройти.::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
